              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nö ömönaabhi aarëngë, nawe naamanyërë gano wanyoorrë Ënooköë aamöragana, kugutuenerria iga narëkora umui wu uruibhöro ro Tauti abhe ömögambi, kehaara Tauti umuene aarëngë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tauti naarööchë këno Ënooköë aarëngë kuya gökora, köhayö akaraga ukuriööka ko Masihi aragamba iga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abhantö bhonsui Abhaisiraeri niiga bhamanye maheene iga, Yesö öno moobhambërë, nëwe Ënooköë aakora aabha Ömönene na Masihi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano abhantö bhaaiguurë igo, mbaairiirrë kumioyo geebho bhagateebhia Bhetero hamui na abhatömöa bhandë bhaara iga, “Bhantö bhaitö nkë törakore bhoono?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhetero akabhateebhia iga, “Bhonsui niiga mutige amaraga gainyu na möbhaatiisöe kuriina re Yesö Kirisitö, korri moöbheröe amaraga gainyu; sooki munyoore igutuho kë Ënooköë, këno kërëngë Nkoro Nhoreeru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kugira ëndagano yë Ënooköë mbainyu yaaraganëëyöë hamui na abhaana bhainyu, na bhano bhonsui bha aharai bhano Ömönene Ënooköë weitö aköbhërëkëra kuya harë we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kömang'ana gandë amaaru Bhetero akabhakörömërra aragamba iga, “Mötaituuria kurua guikora irinyanku rëno!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaaru mbaakumiri amang'ana gaae bhakabhaatiisöa. Abhantö bhano bhakaabha ibhiköë bhitatö, mbaaiyengeeyi guikomo ria abhakumia urusikö röyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ënkaaga yaabho yonsui, mbaagenderreeyi kuëga kurua köbhatömöa bhaamenyërë köbhögootaini, mbaarë gösanga ibhiakörea na amasabhi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Irimenya ria abhakumia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibhimanyiirriö ibhiaru na ibhirögööro mbiakorekainë gököhetera köbhatömöa na këra möntö akabha nö öbhoobha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.4.32+ACT.4.33+ACT.4.34+ACT.4.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ama 4:32-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhakumia bhonsui mbaagenderreeyi köbhögootainë hamui, na mbaarë gösanga ibhintö bhionsui hamui. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhakaya bharaguria ëmëgöndö geebho na ibhintö bhiabho, na bharatuenania abhantö bhonsui ichimbiria hang'ana ömöntö aarëngë na öbhötati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ruiso ronsui, mbaarë gusikana hamui köhekaru na bharërëa ömögaate guchika chaabho, mbaarë körëa ibhiakörëa kömögooko na kimuguuni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhakaya bharagönga Ënooköë, bhagategeria abhantö bhonsui. Na ruiso ronsui, Ömönene akaya arabhiengeria abhantö bhandë bhano bhaarë gutuuribhua.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.2.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
